    "kind": "loot"
   },
   {
    "t": 1794179048214,
    "text": "Pleasure Doing Business: \"Pleasure doing business.\"\n\nThe Rakshasa bows low, one hand over its heart. It drops a small silver-bound bundle at your feet, and nudges the crate toward you with one boot.\n\n\"Keep your heads down up that mountain, eh? Something up there doesn't pay its debts.\"\n\nIt snaps its fingers. Blue smoke rolls up from the rug, and when it clears there is nothing left but the lamp, still burning, and the faint smell of cardamom.",
    "kind": "narrate"
   },
   {
    "t": 1794178957200,
    "text": "The Smuggler's Offer: The Rakshasa lowers its hands. All at once it is smiling again, wide and warm and entirely false.\n\n\"Whoa, whoa, whoa. Easy. Let's not do anything we'll both regret, eh? Look at you lot. Professionals. I respect that. And professionals talk business.\"\n\nIt sweeps its cloak aside. Behind the rug, under a tarp, is a long crate stamped with a dozen different royal seals, none of them its own.\n\n\"Here's the deal. You walk away, I walk away. And you take the crate. Proper merchandise, this. Two pieces, legendary, the kind kings go to war over. You still get the chest. You still get what I'm carrying. I just get to keep breathing. Everybody wins.\"\n\nIt spreads its claws, palms up.\n\n\"Or. You say no. And I show you what else is in the crate.\"\n\nDECIDE: accept the deal, or refuse it?",
    "kind": "narrate"
   },
   {
