    "t": 1794178530399,
    "text": "The Rakshasa: The Rakshasa rises from its rug, unhurried, and looks Lyle up and down like a man inspecting a very small fish.\n\n\"Oh, crikey. Look at you, mate, with your little pointy stick. Bless.\" It glances at Lyle's blade and snorts. \"That's not a knoife.\"\n\nIt raises one clawed hand, and the air above it splits with blue light. A sabre longer than a man and pale as a ghost unfolds from nowhere, humming.\n\n\"THIS is a knoife!\"\n\nIt hurls the spectral blade end over end, straight at Lyle. \"Have a go, ya mug! Fair dinkum, I've seen wombats put up a better fight!\"",
    "kind": "narrate"
   },
   {
    "t": 1794178530351,
    "text": "⚔ The foes attack! Lyle Greenbottle must defend.",
    "kind": "hurt"
